build/
# The bitstreams are shipped with the binary, not with the model directory, so
# these three are tracked despite the repo-wide `*.xclbin` ignore. They are the
# artifacts the resolver in host_common/utils/xclbin_path.hpp looks for next to
# run.exe, and the ones build_package.sh copies into the wheel.
!XCLBINS/*.xclbin
.venv/
build/
packaging/*
*.so
